OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786105097
OL,3,CSouth West hosepipe ban - what does it
OL,4,Cmean and who is affected?
OL,6,FA hosepipe ban will cover most of the
OL,7,FSouth West following prolonged dry
OL,8,Fweather and rising pressure on
OL,9,Fsupplies, South West Water has
OL,10,Fannounced.
OL,12,FThe water firm says due to
OL,13,Fsignificantly below average rainfall
OL,14,Fand high demand on supplies, customers
OL,15,Fin Devon, Cornwall, parts of Dorset
OL,16,Fand Somerset and the Isles of Scilly
OL,17,Fshould not use hosepipes for certain
OL,18,Factivities, from midnight on 8 August.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
