OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786105097
OL,3,CSouth West hosepipe ban - what does it
OL,4,Cmean and who is affected?
OL,6,FCustomers are being urged to avoid
OL,7,Fusing hosepipes for activities
OL,8,Fincluding watering gardens, washing
OL,9,Fcars, patios and boats, or filling
OL,10,Fswimming and paddling pools.
OL,12,FWater can still be used as normal for
OL,13,Fdrinking, flushing toilets, washing
OL,14,Fand cooking, the firm confirmed.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
