CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786105097
OL,3,CSouth West hosepipe ban - what does it
OL,4,Cmean and who is affected?
OL,6,FSam Bottomley from South West Water
OL,7,Fsaid: "After an extended period of
OL,8,Fexceptionally low rainfall, combined
OL,9,Fwith sustained high demand during the
OL,10,Fwarmer weather, our region's rivers
OL,11,Fand water resources are under
OL,12,Fsignificant pressure. This decision
OL,13,Fhas considered the Environment
OL,14,FAgency's drought status as well as the
OL,15,Fincrease in demand in our region.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
