PN,40304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786105097
OL,3,CSouth West hosepipe ban - what does it
OL,4,Cmean and who is affected?
OL,6,F"Our teams have been working
OL,7,Ftirelessly to protect supplies for
OL,8,Fcustomers. We've maximised water
OL,9,Fproduction wherever possible,
OL,10,Fincreased leak detection and repairs,
OL,11,Fmoved water around our network and
OL,12,Fintroduced a wide range of operational
OL,13,Fmeasures to make the best use of the
OL,14,Fwater available.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/5
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
