OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786105097
OL,3,CSouth West hosepipe ban - what does it
OL,4,Cmean and who is affected?
OL,6,F"Introducing a hosepipe ban is never a
OL,7,Fdecision we take lightly, and we fully
OL,8,Fappreciate the inconvenience it will
OL,9,Fcause. However, these temporary
OL,10,Frestrictions are an important step in
OL,11,Fhelping to protect our rivers and
OL,12,Fessential water supplies for homes,
OL,13,Fbusinesses and critical services
OL,14,Facross the region.
OL,16,F"Every litre saved now will help
OL,17,Fprotect our rivers and water resources
OL,18,Fwhile drought conditions continue. By
OL,19,Fmaking small changes to how we use
OL,20,Fwater, our customers can make a real
OL,21,Fdifference."
